#: ../../source/usage.rst:2 53aa0192018047148399d518a5811d39
msgid "_`Usage and verification`"
msgstr "_`用法与验证`"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:4 5c8f9bb63eb54859a2daabf70fed5218
msgid ""
"This page is the part a user actually needs: the three faces of the "
"library, the model behind them, and the evidence that they work."
msgstr "本页是使用者真正需要的部分：库的三个使用面、它们背后的模型，以及它们确实可用的证据。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:8 33e0a1f953ac4ea2a5f4848c0163f40e
msgid "_`C++ path (recommended for board-level work)`"
msgstr "_`C++ 路径（上板首选）`"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:10 8e2e4c0b69b342a0bb2cecd249b4d117
msgid ""
"Every policy is a template parameter: the observer, the modulator, the "
"controllers and the HAL. Nothing is virtual, and swapping a policy costs "
"nothing at run time."
msgstr "所有策略都是模板参数：观测器、调制器、控制器与 HAL。没有虚函数，换策略不付运行时代价。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:13 58556d847da6456296237a5b4fb2b78c
msgid "one motor, one control step"
msgstr "一个电机，一个控制步"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:42 f547f20781494bc9a86ff4b4b174bacf
msgid ""
":code:`tick()` is noexcept, allocates nothing and does no I/O — it is the"
" ISR entry point. The tuning helpers (:code:`current_pi_config`, "
":code:`speed_pi_config`) live in the library so the C path and the SIL "
"bench use exactly the same numbers."
msgstr ""
":code:`tick()` 是 noexcept、不分配、不做 I/O——它就是 ISR 入口。整定辅助"
"函数（ :code:`current_pi_config` 、 :code:`speed_pi_config` ）放在库里，"
"保证 C 路径与 SIL 台架用的是同一组数。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:47 bc3a9c89d5304ac89231592fea1341b4
msgid "_`C path (non-C++ projects, glue code)`"
msgstr "_`C 路径（非 C++ 工程、胶水层）`"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:49 933fb2b9c2464608bbc4c5be2ca20281
msgid "the same motor through the frozen ABI"
msgstr "同一个电机，走冻结的 ABI"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:68 80fc156578fa4ce69f0be9447d0b5ddd
msgid ""
"Handles are opaque tokens carrying a generation counter: after "
":code:`foc_motor_destroy()` an old handle answers :code:`FOC_ERR_PARAM` "
"instead of touching freed memory. The C path runs on the stub HAL with "
"library defaults (20 kHz, 500 ns dead time, 5 A limit, 24 V bus); for "
"real hardware use the C++ path."
msgstr ""
"句柄是带代际计数的不透明令牌：调用 :code:`foc_motor_destroy()` 之后，旧"
"句柄返回 :code:`FOC_ERR_PARAM` ，而不是去碰已释放的内存。C 路径跑在桩"
"HAL 与库内默认值上（20 kHz、500 ns 死区、5 A 限流、24 V 母线）；上真实硬"
"件请走 C++ 路径。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:74 451b6243f20d44b6bc93d0d054166d9a
msgid "_`Python path (host-side scripts)`"
msgstr "_`Python 路径（上位机脚本）`"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:76 6f307e40d54049de89829f08e00b6c25
msgid "the same motor from Python"
msgstr "同一个电机，从 Python 驱动"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:89 6d371e620bd442a4aea7303dd74f4fb4
msgid ""
"The module binds the **C API**. Failures raise "
":code:`foc_python.FocError` whose :code:`code` attribute is the very "
":code:`ErrorCode` the C function returned — Python gets exceptions, you "
"keep the raw code."
msgstr ""
"模块绑定的是 **C API** 。失败抛 :code:`foc_python.FocError` ，其 :code:`"
"code` 属性就是 C 函数返回的那个 :code:`ErrorCode` ——Python 拿到异常，你"
"仍保留原始错误码。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:94 a7c60426176344ceaa1f8ad9aeacc5b8
msgid "_`The model behind the loop`"
msgstr "_`控制环背后的模型`"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:96 07f5184e205e4beebc5943a5e990434c
msgid ""
"The controller sees a dq-frame PMSM. The plant used by the SIL tests "
"integrates exactly this, with fixed-step RK4 at 10 µs against a 100 µs "
"control step:"
msgstr ""
"控制器看到的是 dq 轴 PMSM。SIL 测试用的 plant 就按下面这组方程积分：固定步长 RK4，10 µs 积分步长对 100 µs "
"控制步长："

#: ../../source/usage.rst:99 dd6cfb8d5a1248b489a4cde3e1fbc720
msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\frac{di_d}{dt} &= \\frac{v_d - R_s i_d + \\omega_e L_q i_q}{L_d} \\\\\n"
"\\frac{di_q}{dt} &= \\frac{v_q - R_s i_q - \\omega_e L_d i_d - \\omega_e "
"\\psi_f}{L_q} \\\\\n"
"\\frac{d\\omega_m}{dt} &= \\frac{T_e - B \\omega_m - T_{load}}{J}, "
"\\qquad\n"
"T_e = \\tfrac{3}{2} p \\left(\\psi_f i_q + (L_d - L_q) i_d i_q\\right)\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"% dq 轴电压方程与机械转矩方程\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\frac{di_d}{dt} &= \\"
"frac{v_d - R_s i_d + \\omega_e L_q i_q}{L_d} \\\\\n\\frac{di_q}{dt} &="
"\\frac{v_q - R_s i_q - \\omega_e L_d i_d - \\omega_e \\psi_f}{L_q} \\\\"
"\n\\frac{d\\omega_m}{dt} &= \\frac{T_e - B \\omega_m - T_{load}}{J}, \\"
"qquad\nT_e = \\tfrac{3}{2} p \\left(\\psi_f i_q + (L_d - L_q) i_d i_q\\"
"right)\n\\end{aligned}"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:109 676e399bc60d477cb5cc8b213eaf5bd1
msgid ""
"with :math:`\\psi_f = K_t / (1.5 p)` and :math:`\\omega_e = "
"p\\,\\omega_m`. The torque constant is *knot* the back-EMF constant: "
"conflating them is the classic way to be wrong by 1.5 p."
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`\\psi_f = K_t / (1.5 p)` 、 :math:`\\omega_e = p\\,\\omega_m"
"` 。转矩常数 **不是** 反电动势常数：把两者混为一谈，正是差 1.5 p 的经典"
"错法。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:112 1c9e5e2db33f4e97a58aac48cad317f0
msgid ""
"**How that model earns its place.** Everything else in this documentation"
" is measured against it, so it is the one thing that cannot be taken on "
"trust. Four checks, none of which is a comparison with itself:"
msgstr ""
"**这个模型凭什么站得住。** 本文档其余内容都以它为基准测量，因此它是唯一"
"不能凭信任接受的东西。四项检查，没有一项是与自己的比较："

#: ../../source/usage.rst:115 f8937b0758114e539c42191bc284bf20
msgid ""
"**The equations above are the equations the plant integrates** -- same "
"terms, same `psi_f = Kt/(1.5p)` substitution, and the header block states"
" them next to the code that computes them."
msgstr ""
"**上面的方程就是 plant 积分的方程** ——同样的各项、同样的 `psi_f = Kt/("
"1.5p)` 代换，而且头文件里把它们写在了计算它们的代码旁边。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:117 59982200e85f4b12aefa31d31975fa01
msgid ""
"**An independent formulation agrees.** `sil_abc_plant.hpp` integrates the"
" three phase fluxes directly from `v = Rs*i + d(lambda)/dt` with "
"`lambda_p = (Ls - M)*i_p + lambda_m*cos(theta_p)` and derives torque from"
" co-energy, without Clarke, Park or `psi_f`. The two models agree on "
"`i_d`/`i_q` to 2 % and on torque, and on the electrical time constant: "
"two different formulations of the same physics is the strongest evidence "
"available without a bench."
msgstr ""
"**独立的写法给出同样的结果。** `sil_abc_plant.hpp` 直接用 `v = Rs*i + d("
"lambda)/dt` 与 `lambda_p = (Ls - M)*i_p + lambda_m*cos(theta_p)` 对三相"
"磁链积分，并由共能导出转矩，不经过 Clarke、Park，也不用 `psi_f` 。两个模"
"型在 `i_d` /`i_q` 上一致到 2 %、在转矩上一致，电气时间常数也一致：同一套"
"物理的两种不同写法，是没有台架时能拿到的最强证据。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:121 053d88f1592145bca466ee914028b855
msgid ""
"**Analytic anchors.** An `RL` step matches the closed-form solution; the "
"mechanical steady state satisfies the torque balance; positive torque at "
"positive speed delivers mechanical power; phase currents round-trip back "
"to the dq frame; `psi_f` follows the torque constant."
msgstr ""
"**解析锚点。** `RL` 阶跃与闭式解一致；机械稳态满足转矩平衡；正转速下的正"
"转矩输出机械功率；相电流能往返回到 dq 坐标； `psi_f` 与转矩常数对应。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:124 fa9994cf110d4b51ba275836f09f1e15
msgid ""
"**A conservation law at the frequency it is used at.** `P_elec = P_copper"
" + dW/dt + P_mech`, with `W = 1.5*(Ld*id^2/2 + Lq*iq^2/2 + psi_f*id)`, "
"run at **900 rad/s electrical**: 11313.95 J in, 11302.81 J out as copper "
"plus mechanical work over 0.1 s (**0.098 %**), and the worst single "
"period within **0.37 %**. One invariant catches a wrong factor of 1.5, a "
"wrong `psi_f` and a cross-coupling sign at the same time."
msgstr ""
"**在它被使用的频率上守一条守恒律。** `P_elec = P_copper + dW/dt + P_mech"
"` ，其中 `W = 1.5*(Ld*id^2/2 + Lq*iq^2/2 + psi_f*id)` ，在 **900 rad/s电"
"气** 下运行：0.1 s 内输入 11313.95 J，以铜耗加机械功输出 11302.81 J（ **"
"0.098 %** ），单个周期的最坏值在 **0.37 %** 以内。一个不变量同时抓住错的"
"1.5 系数、错的 `psi_f` 和交叉耦合的符号。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:129 edfd9e61bdb54b5ebd62f68af3b7065c
msgid ""
"What none of the four do is say the *parameters* describe a real motor. "
"Saturation, iron loss and winding temperature are modelled and **off by "
"default**; the plant is exact for the machine it describes and says "
"nothing about a specific one. That is why every claim in this library is "
"of the form \"this algorithm does X on a machine described by these "
"equations\" -- falsifiable, and true -- and none of them is of the form "
"\"this will work on your motor\", which would need a bench."
msgstr ""
"这四项都不说明这些 *参数* 描述的是真实电机。饱和、铁耗与绕组温度都已建模"
"，默认 **关闭** ；plant 对它描述的那台机器是精确的，对具体某一台则什么也"
"没说。这就是为什么本库的每条主张都写成“这个算法在一台由这些方程描述的机"
"器上做到 X”——可证伪，而且成立——没有一条写成“这在你的电机上能用”，那需要"
"台架。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:135 faa9404188514b2bbbfe83bd09982e74
msgid "_`Sizing the injection (HFI)`"
msgstr ""
"_`注入的定量（HFI）`"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:137 d62b1a8311fb4308bb107bf8534e714e
msgid ""
"The injection observer buys an angle where back-EMF has nothing to say, "
"and it is not free. Every number below was measured on the SIL envelope "
"fixture — a loaded machine held at a given speed on a dyno, the observer "
"as a passenger, so a cell is a property of the observer and not of a loop"
" closing on it."
msgstr ""
"注入观测器在反电动势无从说话的地方换来一个角度，而这并不免费。下面每个数"
"字都在 SIL 包络台架上测得——一台带载电机在测功机上被保持在给定转速，观测"
"器只是乘客，因此每一格都是观测器自身的性质，而不是某个闭合在它上面的环的"
"性质。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:141 3f2466a3e9684015b85e601e858338c8
msgid ""
"**The carrier has a ceiling set by the control rate.** Ask for it rather "
"than guess:"
msgstr ""
"**载波有上限，由控制频率决定。** 去问它，而不是猜它："

#: ../../source/usage.rst:150 ad0ec27aa5984a00905e146c90730b1a
msgid ""
"The same question from C is :code:`foc_hfi_max_inject_hz(pwm_freq_hz)`. "
"Past the ceiling the observer does not get noisy, it stops: the "
"demodulated amplitude collapses, the lock detector drops out, the angle "
"freezes and the speed reads zero, which a loop cannot tell from a stalled"
" rotor — measured as a -19.5 rad/s speed bias before the failure was "
"understood. :code:`foc_motor_create_ex()` refuses such a request, and the"
" cases it cannot catch are reported by :code:`observer_locked`."
msgstr ""
"从 C 侧问同一个问题是 :code:`foc_hfi_max_inject_hz(pwm_freq_hz)` 。越过"
"上限之后观测器不是变吵，而是停住：解调幅值塌陷、锁定检测掉出、角度冻结、"
"速度读数为零，环无法把它与堵转的转子区分开——这一失效被理解之前，它表现为"
"-19.5 rad/s 的速度偏差。 :code:`foc_motor_create_ex()` 拒绝这类请求，抓"
"不住的情形由 :code:`observer_locked` 报告。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:156 93e48030c8b04c638111daf72c96f0d4
msgid ""
"The same admission test runs when the observer is changed on a running "
"motor: :code:`Motor.set_observer()` -- :code:`foc_motor_set_observer()` "
"from C -- validates the request against the setup already in force, so a "
"motor built without a carrier can run on back-EMF but cannot be handed "
"over to HFI later. Outside the Run state it answers :code:`STATE` "
"instead, because a hand-over carries an estimate and an observer that has"
" not been stepped has none to carry. Both refusals arrive as "
":code:`FocError`, never as a silently unchanged "
":code:`status()[\"observer\"]`."
msgstr ""
"在运行中的电机上更换观测器时，同一套准入测试会再跑一遍： :code:`"
"Motor.set_observer()` ——C 侧是 :code:`foc_motor_set_observer()` ——拿请求"
"去对已在生效的 setup 校验，因此一台没配载波的电机可以跑反电动势，但之后"
"不能移交给 HFI。在 Run 状态之外它改答 :code:`STATE` ，因为移交要带走一个"
"估计值，而一个从未被推进过的观测器没有估计值可带。两种拒绝都以 :code:`"
"FocError` 到达，绝不会表现为 :code:`status()[\"observer\"]` 悄悄不变。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:162 4e713bf28ec9405ea150881469b8a263
msgid ""
"Within the ceiling, higher is better on both axes at once, because the "
"angle bias falls faster than the injected current:"
msgstr ""
"在上限之内，越高越好，两个轴同时变好，因为角度偏差下降得比注入电流更快："

#: ../../source/usage.rst:164 bafaa309cd7948a6ab2a96dc8b958419
msgid "20 rad/s mechanical, 200 Hz demodulation, 12 V"
msgstr ""
