#: ../../source/usage.rst:378 a88af1c5c6e541e5a5df9938b97fd3c8
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The analysis layer also carries a spectrum and a THD (`analyze.spectrum`,"
" `analyze.thd`), checked against a signal whose answer is arithmetic "
"rather than a modelling opinion: a unit tone reads 1.000 under a Hann "
"window with the usual 2/sum correction, and a known 11.2 % distortion "
"made of a 10 % third harmonic and a 5 % fifth reads 0.1118 with each "
"harmonic in its own bin. Neither has a C-side counterpart, and neither "
"needs one: they measure the window, not the loop."
msgstr ""
"分析层还带一个频谱与一个 THD（ `analyze.spectrum` 、 `analyze.thd` ），"
"对着一个答案来自算术而不是建模意见的信号校验：单位音调在 Hann 窗配常规"
"2/sum修正下读出 1.000；一个已知 11.2 % 的失真，由 10 % 三次谐波与 5 % 五"
"次谐波组成，读出 0.1118，且每个谐波各在自己的频率格内。两者都没有 C 侧对"
"应物，也不需要：它们测的是窗口，不是环。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:383 ff72640ffdcd44a5866054164eff51c5
msgid ""
"**Break a stuck axis loose on purpose.** A speed PI does eventually break"
" a stuck axis free -- its integral ramps the current until the torque "
"passes the breakaway point -- and that is the problem: by then the "
"integral has stored the whole windup, so the moment the rotor lets go the"
" stored torque drives it past the setpoint. `core/stall_start.hpp` does "
"the same thing deliberately: a known torque ramp, a report the instant "
"the rotor moves, and the torque it moved on as the handover value."
msgstr ""
"**有意识地把卡住的轴撬开。** 速度 PI 最终确实能把卡住的轴撬开——它的积分"
"把电流一路顶到转矩越过起动点——而这正是问题：到那时积分已经存下全部绕入量"
"，转子一松，存下的转矩就把它推过给定。 `core/stall_start.hpp` 刻意做同一"
"件事：一条已知的转矩斜坡、转子一动就给出的报告，以及它起动时所用的转矩作"
"为交接值。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:398 f4cdce5f636843e2a548eeab7fc68a3d
msgid ""
"Measured: 0.030 N*m of breakaway at 0.5 N*m/s is reached and released at "
"**60.1 ms**; against a real stuck plant (stiction 0.020 N*m, load 0.010 "
"N*m) the sequence releases at **0.0307 N*m after 61.3 ms**, and a 0.9x "
"torque -- a sequence asking for less than it believes -- moves that to "
"68.0 ms and the case fails. A jam at the limit reports `Failed` with zero"
" torque after 400 ms of ramp plus a 200 ms grace."
msgstr ""
"实测：以 0.5 N *m/s 爬升到 0.030 N* m 的起动力矩，在 **60.1 ms** 达到并"
"释放；对一个真实的卡死 plant（静摩擦 0.020 N *m、负载 0.010 N* m），序列"
"在 * *61.3 ms 后于 0.0307 N* m** 释放；把转矩打到 0.9x——序列要的比它以为"
"的少——则推到 68.0 ms，该用例失败。在限幅处卡死时，序列在 400 ms 斜坡加"
"200 ms宽限之后报 `Failed` 并输出零转矩。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:403 1e75473415d643a18d1ca5fc0aa971ec
msgid ""
"**Turn a standing error into arithmetic.** A proportional position loop "
"on a machine with friction has a *dead band*, not a residual: below a "
"certain error the torque it can still ask for is under the breakaway and "
"the axis does not move at all. `core/friction_comp.hpp` adds the Coulomb "
"term that moves that wall, and refuses the estimates that would turn it "
"into a motor."
msgstr ""
"**把静态误差变成算术。** 带摩擦的机器上，比例位置环留下的是一个 *死区*"
"，而不是残差：误差小到某个值以下，它还能要求的转矩低于起动点，轴就完全不"
"动。 `core/friction_comp.hpp` 加上那一项库仑项，把这道墙移开，并拒绝那些"
"会把它变成一个电机的估计值。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:414 b99d12998daf451fbdc2393120f038b0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The numbers are the capability. The band is `static / kp` -- **4.003 mrad"
" measured against 4.0 predicted** at `kp = 5 N*m/rad` -- and with the "
"compensation it is `(static - coulomb) / kp`, **2.021 against 2.0**. It "
"follows the estimate, which is why the estimate has to come from a "
"measurement: 1.007 mrad with a 50 % over-estimate, and above the "
"breakaway there is no band at all -- a `(0.030, 0.030)` estimate walks "
"the axis **5.625 mrad with the reference held at zero and no command at "
"all**."
msgstr ""
"这些数就是能力本身。死区宽度是 `static / kp` ——在 `kp = 5 N*m/rad` 下 **"
"实测 4.003 mrad，预测 4.0** ——加上补偿后是 `(static - coulomb) / kp` ， "
"**2.021 对 2.0** 。它跟着估计值走，这也是估计值必须来自测量的原因：高估"
"50% 时为 1.007 mrad；而在起动点以上根本没有死区——一个 `(0.030, 0.030)` "
"的估计值，在给定始终为零、完全没有任何指令的情况下，让轴 **走动 "
"5.625mrad** 。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:420 a435ab7a6b7d4b8f896628f0504839d3
msgid ""
"The latch is not decoration. At rest the measured speed is zero-mean "
"noise, so a Coulomb term on `sign(speed)` is a square wave of amplitude "
"twice the term: measured with +-0.01 rad/s of encoder noise, the naive "
"law ripples **20.03 mN*m** peak to peak and the latched one **0.036**, "
"550 times quieter, while both park the axis in the same place."
msgstr ""
"锁存不是装饰。静止时实测转速是零均值噪声，因此作用在 `sign(speed)` 上的"
"库仑项是一个幅度为该项两倍的方波：在 +-0.01 rad/s 的编码器噪声下实测，朴"
"素做法峰峰值纹波 * *20.03 mN* m **，锁存做法** 0.036**，安静 550 倍，而"
"两者都把轴停在同一处。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:424 16de8a2e3a4746bb93ec0d9d41c22a1c
msgid ""
"**Keep an axis out of a wall, and gear two axes together.** Two small "
"stages for the shapes an AGV or a winder needs. `core/soft_limit.hpp` "
"refuses a target outside the window (status, not a clamp -- a clamp makes"
" a programming fault look plausible) and caps the velocity on the way in:"
msgstr ""
"**让轴离墙远一点，并把两根轴啮合起来。** 两段小环节，对应 AGV 或卷绕机需"
"要的形状。 `core/soft_limit.hpp` 拒绝窗口外的目标（返回状态，而不是钳位—"
"—钳位会让一处编程错误看起来合理），并在进去的路上限制速度："

#: ../../source/usage.rst:434 a2cddfee105a4f8ba98d9b086f68db23
msgid ""
"The ceiling is `v^2 <= 2*a*(d - v*dt)`, and the `v*dt` term is what makes"
" it work: at 20 rad/s toward a wall the axis crosses by **19 mm** without"
" it and stops **1.04 mm short** with it, where 19 mm is exactly the 1 ms "
"this drive takes to deliver a braking current. `core/gear_ratio.hpp` is "
"the other half of an AGV:"
msgstr ""
"上限是 `v^2 <= 2*a*(d - v*dt)` ，而让这个式子管用的是 `v*dt` 这一项：以"
"20 rad/s 冲向一堵墙，没有它时轴越过 **19 mm** ，有它时停在还差 **1.04 mm"
"** 处，其中 19 mm 恰好是本驱动交付制动电流所需的 1 ms。 `"
"core/gear_ratio.hpp` 是 AGV 的另一半："

#: ../../source/usage.rst:445 95e03c32629d4ad99317b23677e1ad6a
msgid ""
"The unwrap is not a detail: three wrapped revolutions become 18.85 rad of"
" continuous reference instead of two 6.28 rad jumps. And the "
"synchronisation error of a *perfectly geared* pair is `v*kd/kp` -- **25.6"
" mrad measured against 25.0 predicted**, linear in the rate and inverse "
"in the gain -- which the velocity output removes (1.3 mrad). A gear that "
"emits only a position is a lag generator with a ratio."
msgstr ""
"解缠不是细节：三圈卷绕的圈数变成 18.85 rad 的连续给定，而不是两次"
"6.28rad 的跳变。而一对 *完全啮合* 的传动，其同步误差是 `v*kd/kp` —— **实"
"测 25.6mrad，预测 25.0** ，随速率线性、随增益反比——速度输出把它消掉（1.3"
"mrad）。只输出位置的传动，是一台带减速比的滞后发生器。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:450 3630c50652634162b5d17888a6652648
msgid ""
"**Run a motor from three Hall sensors.** `core/hall.hpp` carries the two "
"things a Hall drive needs and nothing else: the six-step table, and an "
"electrical angle interpolated from edge timing."
msgstr ""
"**用三个霍尔传感器跑电机。** `core/hall.hpp` 只装霍尔驱动需要的两样东西"
"，别的没有：六步换相表，以及由边沿时刻插值出的电角度。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:461 ab18cfa3c450419fa8299684f65e7a02
msgid ""
"The numbers that decide whether that is enough. Held at one commutation "
"state, the torque is the cosine of where the rotor sits in the sector: "
"maximum at the centre, **0.866 at both edges, never negative** -- a 14.0 "
"% peak-to-peak ripple that six-step cannot avoid, and the argument for "
"interpolating an angle at all. Interpolating buys a factor of **52 at 120"
" rad/s electrical** (0.338 degrees RMS against the sector centre's "
"17.52), and the factor shrinks to 7.5 at 900 rad/s because what is left "
"is one *sampling period* of rotation (2.30 degrees at 62.5 us) rather "
"than the 60-degree sector."
msgstr ""
"决定这样够不够的那些数。锁在一个换相状态上时，转矩是转子在扇区内位置的余"
"弦：中间最大， **两个边沿处 0.866，从不为负** ——这是六步无法避免的 14.0"
"%峰峰纹波，也是插值角度之所以必要的理由。插值买到 **在 120 rad/s 电气下"
"的52 倍** （相对扇区中心的 17.52，RMS 为 0.338 度）；到 900 rad/s 时这个"
"倍数缩到 7.5，因为剩下的是一个 *采样周期* 的转动（62.5 us 下 2.30 度），"
"而不是整个 60 度扇区。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:467 c8129339ab4f4767a11d6ca0f15cf4b6
#, python-format
msgid ""
"What it cannot do is in the same header: with a sensor stuck, `Fault` "
"covers 15.5 % of a revolution and `State` another 53.9 %, and **8.4 % "
"still reads `Ok` while wrong by up to 59 degrees**. The status is the "
"whole admission story -- an estimate that is not being measured says so "
"rather than reporting a sector centre as if it were a measurement."
msgstr ""
"它做不到的事写在同一个头文件里：一个传感器卡住时， `Fault` 覆盖一圈中的"
"15.5 %， `State` 再覆盖 53.9 %，还有 **8.4 % 仍读 `Ok`，而误差可达 59 度"
"** 。状态就是准入的全部说法——一个并非由测量得到的估计值会说出来，而不是"
"把扇区中心当作测量结果报出去。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:471 d41ebefb25804c5aa0ae18983b134fe1
msgid ""
"**A fault is not a temperature.** Protection is graded -- derate, then "
"trip -- and the two decisions are separate fields rather than one code: "
"`output_allowed` is defined as `active_mask == 0`, so a **fault means "
"authority was removed**, while a **derating** drive is still running and "
"says so through `i_limit_a` falling below the `i_max_a` the caller "
"configured. Measured on the ladder case: 3.00 A at 45 C, **1.80 A at 80 C"
" with output still allowed and no fault**, then 0 A and no output at 105 "
"C. When two faults are active at once the lower-ranked one is reported "
"and both bits stay visible in `active_mask` (0x006 for current plus "
"voltage, 0x018 for voltage plus heat)."
msgstr ""
"**故障不是温度。** 保护是分级的——先降额，再跳闸——这两个决定是两个独立字"
"段而不是一个错误码： `output_allowed` 定义为 `active_mask == 0` ，因此 *"
"*故障意味着权限被收回** ，而一个正在 **降额** 的驱动仍在运行，并通过 `"
"i_limit_a` 低于调用方配置的 `i_max_a` 说出来。在阶梯用例上实测：45 C 时"
"3.00 A， **80 C 时 1.80 A，输出仍被允许且无故障** ，到 105 C 则为 0 A、"
"无输出。同时有两个故障时报告等级较低的那个，两个位都留在 `active_mask` "
"里可见（电流加电压为 0x006，电压加过温为 0x018）。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:478 3b89a88883be4603b8053a99303cb80f
msgid ""
"**Command a torque, not an amperage.** `set_torque()` takes amps and "
"leaves the N*m conversion to the caller -- the same arithmetic, with the "
"same sign convention and the same limit, in every product. "
"`foc/motor/torque_map.hpp` is that arithmetic once:"
msgstr ""
"**指令给转矩，不是给安培。** `set_torque()` 收的是安培，把 N*m 的换算留"
"给调用方——在每个产品里都是同一套算术、同样的符号约定、同样的限幅。 `"
"foc/motor/torque_map.hpp` 把这段算术只写一次："

#: ../../source/usage.rst:489 d19b59a2e05f4cc280012c41e314e46e
msgid ""
"The estimate is `kt*iq + 1.5*pp*(ld-lq)*id*iq`, which is the expression "
"the plant integrates -- so it is checked against something that shares no"
" line with it: the mechanical torque `J*dw/dt + B*w` from the recorded "
"speed. The two agree to **+0.006 % at 2 A** and **+0.007 % at 20 A**, "
"where the loop is saturated; the plan's 5 % band is three orders of "
"magnitude wider than the measured residual, which is the forward-"
"difference error in `dw/dt`. Scaling the map's gain by 10 % moves the "
"same measurement to **-9.994 %**, so the band is a gate rather than "
"decoration."
msgstr ""
"估计式是 `kt*iq + 1.5*pp*(ld-lq)*id*iq` ，也就是 plant 所积分的那条表达"
"式——因此拿一个与它不共用任何一行的量来核对：由录制转速算出的机械转矩 `J*"
"dw/dt + B*w` 。两者在 **2 A 下一致到 +0.006 %** 、在环已饱和的 **20 A 下"
"一致到 +0.007 %** ；计划里的 5 % 区间比实测残差宽三个数量级，那点残差正"
"是 `dw/dt` 的前向差分误差。把映射的增益缩放 10 %，同一测量变为 **-9.994"
"%** ，所以这条区间是门禁，不是装饰。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:495 b17e7358f7794c0c84e24a5842705e99
msgid ""
"**Ask what a wrong nameplate costs.** Every gain here is derived from the"
" nameplate, so the design question is how wrong it can be before the "
"claim stops holding. `benchmark/script/montecarlo.py` draws machines, "
"runs the loop on each and reports the spread:"
msgstr ""
"**问一问铭牌错了要付多少。** 这里每个增益都从铭牌导出，因此设计问题是："
"它错到什么程度，主张就不再成立。 `benchmark/script/montecarlo.py` 抽样生"
"成机器，对每台跑一遍环，并报告离散程度："

#: ../../source/usage.rst:504 f89761ea423b4ca6b8cb40188ac6b4dc
#, python-format
msgid ""
"With a 10 % standard deviation on six nameplate parameters, a **matched**"
" family -- every drawn machine described correctly by its own nameplate "
"-- spreads **2.92 %** in bandwidth and 97.5 % of it stays inside the 10 %"
" band, while the **mismatched** family spreads **19.18 %** and 42.5 % of "
"it does. At 20 % the same pair reads 6.21 % against 29.74 % (yields 92.5 "
"% and 12.5 %). That factor of about six and a half is what deriving every"
" gain from the nameplate buys, and it is the only number on this page "
"that states it as a quantity rather than a design intention. All four "
"figures are `--trials 40 --seed 11`, the seed the suite uses."
msgstr ""
"六个铭牌参数取 10 % 标准差时， **匹配** 的一族——每台抽到的机器都被自己的"
"铭牌正确描述——带宽离散 **2.92 %** ，其中 97.5 % 落在 10 % 区间内；而 **"
"不匹配** 的一族离散 **19.18 %** ，只有 42.5 % 落进去。取 20 % 时同一对照"
"读数为6.21 % 对 29.74 %（合格率 92.5 % 与 12.5 %）。那个约六倍半的倍数，"
"就是“每个增益都从铭牌导出”换来的东西；它也是本页唯一一个把这个收益写成量"
"、而不是写成设计意图的数字。四个数字都是 `--trials 40 --seed 11` ，即测"
"试套件用的种子。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:511 fdd46eafe3c24ab187e497738657be6f
#, python-format
msgid ""
"A single parameter moves predictably, which is the arithmetic behind `kp "
"= wb*J/Kt`: a nameplate `J` 10 % high raises the bandwidth 8.46 % (the "
"1.40 % shortfall is the mechanical pole `B/J` only partly cancelled, "
"since `ki = wb*B/Kt` does not move with `J`), and a nameplate `kt` 10 % "
"high lowers it 9.28 % (prediction 9.09 %, within 0.2 %)."
msgstr ""
"单个参数的变化可以预测，这就是 `kp = wb*J/Kt` 背后的算术：铭牌 `J` 偏高"
"10 % 使带宽升高 8.46 %（少掉的 1.40 % 是因为机械极点 `B/J` 只被部分对消—"
"— `ki = wb*B/Kt` 不随 `J` 变），铭牌 `kt` 偏高 10 % 则使它降低 9.28 %（"
"预测 9.09 %，相差 0.2 % 以内）。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:515 eaa4d8fa5ee3451eb29a30110ae937fd
msgid ""
"Read back through the CLI, the ledger's own `speed_step_100` window "
"measures **197.59 rad/s** against the 200 rad/s the library defaults to "
"(-1.2 %) -- on a window decimated to one sample per millisecond against a"
" four-millisecond time constant. That is the analysis layer replaying a "
"stored file rather than the object that produced it."
msgstr ""
"通过 CLI 读回来，台账自带的 `speed_step_100` 窗口测出 **197.59 rad/s** "
"，而库默认为 200 rad/s（-1.2 %）——而且是在一个抽成每毫秒一条采样的窗口上"
"，对着四毫秒的时间常数。那是分析层在重放一个存下来的文件，而不是在重放产"
"生它的那个对象。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:519 e9e1adeab8044d058ecc7d28061e61ca
msgid ""
"What it cannot do: a first-order fit on a response that is not first-"
"order reports the first-order *equivalent*, which is a real number and "
"not the system's bandwidth -- which is why the band above is 10 % and is "
"attributed rather than assumed."
msgstr ""
"它做不到的：对一条并非一阶的响应做一阶拟合，报出的是它的一阶 *等效* ，那"
"是个真实的数，但不是系统的带宽——这就是上面那条区间取 10 %、且要靠归因而"
"不是假定的原因。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:524 4f054f7a628144b4925a5b05e030f28d
msgid "_`Verification: what is actually checked`"
msgstr "_`验证：到底检查了什么`"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:526 cf7272249a164042b59eb3acaa7c72ba
msgid ""
"Every number below is produced by the commands in the same column, on the"
" same commit."
msgstr "下面每个数字都由同一行的命令、在同一 commit 上产出。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:528 f726222f0f77452d9c740d18b2fc9b98
msgid ""
"The rightmost column is the **evidence level** (defined in the project "
"README): L1 is enforced by construction, L2 is measured against the model"
" in this repository with the criterion written first, L3 adds a measured "
"sensitivity to the model being wrong, L4 would be measured on real "
"hardware. **There are no L4 claims** -- no motor has been attached to any"
" of this. Read every number below as \"true of the documented model\", "
"and use :code:`BoardSelfTest` / :code:`check_board()` to find out whether"
" your hardware matches that model."
msgstr ""
"最右一列是 **证据等级** （定义见项目 README）：L1 由构造本身保证，L2 对"
"着本仓库的模型测量且判据先行写出，L3 再补上“模型错了会怎样”的实测灵敏度"
"，L4 需要在真实硬件上测量。 **没有任何 L4 主张** ——这些东西没有接上过任"
"何一台电机。下面每个数字都读作“对文档所述模型为真”，并用 :code:`"
"BoardSelfTest` / :code:`check_board()` 查明你的硬件是否与该模型相符。"

